    <deftitle>BMS46 M43B19 Q28G CODE-ONLY MASTER REBASED v35 SCALAR REVIEW COMPANION GALLETTO 32KB</deftitle>
    <description>CODE-ONLY master rebased v35 scalar-review companion. v34 axis annotations preserved. Direct scalar/gate constants referenced by code are added in a separate DO-NOT-EDIT-YET category for review; they are not descriptor maps and should not be treated as proven tuning maps yet. Same 233 code-flow reviewed tables and v32 binary address audit. Only physically proven ignition-domain value formulas remain applied in-table: direct ignition raw*0.75-22.5 and additive ignition (raw-30)*0.75. Input axes are now annotated with code-traced RAM roles, but their math remains RAW unless proven; this improves readability without inventing RPM/load/temp formulas. External Ronin/Wiki/KP/XDF names are not proof; formula promotions are based on Ghidra code-flow only.</description>
